   "texto": [
    "When you arrive: **Ich habe eine Reservierung** (I have a reservation).",
    "The rooms: **ein Einzelzimmer** (individual) and **ein Doppelzimmer** (double). The nights: **für zwei Nächte**.",
    "To confirm: **Ja, genau** (yes, exactly).",
    "Plants: **im ersten Stock**, **im zweiten Stock**, **im dritten Stock**. Eye: In Germany the ground floor does not count, so «erster Stock» is our first floor."
